### Récupérer tous les clients
GET http://localhost:8000/api/client

### Créer un nouveau client
POST http://localhost:8000/api/client
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Diop",
  "prenom": "Fatou",
  "telephone": "221701234567",
  "cni": "SN1234567890123",
  "adresse": "Rue Diop 15, Dakar",
  "civilite": "F"
}

### Récupérer un client par ID (remplacer {id} par un vrai ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/client/1

### Mettre à jour un client
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/client/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Diop",
  "prenom": "Fatou",
  "telephone": "221701234568",
  "cni": "SN1234567890123",
  "adresse": "Rue Diop 16, Dakar",
  "civilite": "F"
}

### Supprimer un client
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/client/1 